#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/sunnylink.py:180
msgid ""
"(Only for highest tiers, and does NOT bring ANY benefit to you yet. We are "
"just testing data volume.)"
msgstr "（僅限最高等級用戶，目前不會為您帶來任何好處。我們只是在測試資料量。）"

#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/sunnylink.py:311
msgid ", but we'll be here when you're ready to come back."
msgstr ", 但當你準備好回來時我們會在這裡。"

msgid ""
"<b>WARNING: sunnypilot longitudinal control is in alpha for this car and "
"will disable Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB).</b><br><br>On this car, "
"sunnypilot defaults to the car's built-in ACC instead of sunnypilot's "
"longitudinal control. Enable this to switch to sunnypilot longitudinal "
"control. Enabling Experimental mode is recommended when enabling sunnypilot "
"longitudinal control alpha. Changing this setting will restart sunnypilot if"
" the car is powered on."
msgstr "<b>警告：此車款的 sunnypilot 縱向控制仍為 alpha，將會停用自動緊急煞車 (AEB)。</b><br><br>在此車款上，sunnypilot 預設使用車載 ACC，而非 sunnypilot 的縱向控制。啟用此選項可切換為 sunnypilot 縱向控制。建議同時啟用實驗模式。若車輛通電，變更此設定將會重新啟動 sunnypilot。"

msgid ""
"A beautiful rainbow effect on the path the model wants to take. It does not "
"affect driving in any way."
msgstr "在模型預測的路徑上顯示美麗的彩虹效果。這完全不會影響駕駛。"

msgid ""
"A chime and on-screen alert will play when the traffic light you are waiting"
" for turns green and you have no vehicle in front of you.<br>Note: This "
"chime is only designed as a notification. It is the driver's responsibility "
"to observe their environment and make decisions accordingly."
msgstr ""
"當您等待的交通信號燈變綠且前方無車輛時，將會播放提示音並顯示螢幕提醒。<br>注意：此提示僅作為通知用途。駕駛員有責任觀察周圍環境並做出相應決策。"

msgid ""
"A chime and on-screen alert will play when you are stopped, and the vehicle "
"in front of you start moving.<br>Note: This chime is only designed as a "
"notification. It is the driver's responsibility to observe their environment"
" and make decisions accordingly."
msgstr ""
"當您處於停車狀態，且前方車輛開始移動時，將會播放提示音並顯示螢幕提醒。<br>注意：此提示僅作為通知用途。駕駛員有責任觀察周圍環境並做出相應決策。"

