#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/developer.py:71
msgid "sunnypilot Longitudinal Control (Alpha)"
msgstr "sunnypilot 縱向控制 (Alpha)"

msgid ""
"sunnypilot Longitudinal Control is the default longitudinal control for this"
" platform."
msgstr "sunnypilot 縱向控制是該車輛上的預設縱向控制。"

#: selfdrive/ui/onroad/alert_renderer.py:51
msgid "sunnypilot Unavailable"
msgstr "無法使用 sunnypilot"

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/toggles.py:158
msgid ""
"sunnypilot defaults to driving in chill mode. Experimental mode enables "
"alpha-level features that aren't ready for chill mode. Experimental features"
" are listed below:<br><h4>End-to-End Longitudinal Control</h4><br>Let the "
"driving model control the gas and brakes. sunnypilot will drive as it thinks"
" a human would, including stopping for red lights and stop signs. Since the "
"driving model decides the speed to drive, the set speed will only act as an "
"upper bound. This is an alpha quality feature; mistakes should be "
"expected.<br><h4>New Driving Visualization</h4><br>The driving visualization"
" will transition to the road-facing wide-angle camera at low speeds to "
"better show some turns. The Experimental mode logo will also be shown in the"
" top right corner."
msgstr ""
"sunnypilot預設以舒適模式駕駛。實驗模式啟用尚未準備好 進入舒適模式的alpha級功能。實驗功能如下所示： "
"<br><h4>端到端縱向控制</h4><br>讓駕駛模型控制油門和剎車。 sunnypilot將按照人類的駕駛方式來行駛，包括在紅燈和停車標誌前停車。"
" 由於駕駛模型決定行駛速度，設定速度僅作為上限。 這是一個alpha質量的功能；應預期會出現錯誤。 "
"<br><h4>新的駕駛可視化</h4><br>駕駛可視化 將在低速時切換到面向道路的廣角攝像頭， 以更好地顯示某些轉彎。實驗模式標識也將顯示在右上角。"

msgid ""
"sunnypilot is continuously calibrating, resetting is rarely required. "
"Resetting calibration will restart sunnypilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr "sunnypilot 會持續進行校準，因此很少需要重置。 如果車輛電源已開啟，重置校準需要重新啟動 sunnypilot"

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/firehose.py:20
msgid ""
"sunnypilot learns to drive by watching humans, like you, "
"drive.\\n\\nFirehose Mode allows you to maximize your training data uploads "
"to improve openpilot's driving models. More data means bigger models, which "
"means better Experimental Mode."
msgstr ""
"sunnypilot通過觀察人類（比如您）駕駛來學習駕駛。\\n\\n訓練數據上傳模式 "
"可讓您最大化訓練數據的上傳量，以提升openpilot的駕駛模型性能。數據越多，模型越大，實驗模式的性能也就越好。"

msgid "sunnypilot longitudinal control may come in a future update."
msgstr "sunnypilot縱向控制可能會在未來的更新中提供。"

msgid ""
"sunnypilot will not take over control of gas and brakes. Factory Toyota "
"longitudinal control will be used."
msgstr "sunnypilot不會接管油門和剎車的控制權。 系統將使用豐田原廠的縱向控制功能。"

msgid "### Human Turn Detection ###"
msgstr "### 人工轉彎檢測 ###"

msgid "Enable Human Turn Detection"
msgstr "啟用人工轉彎檢測(HTD)"

msgid ""
"Unavailable during cruise control.Automatically pause steering when the "
"driver applies large manual steering input, then smoothly resume."
msgstr "巡航控制期間不可用。當駕駛員進行大幅度手動轉向時，自動暫停轉向，然後平穩恢復。"

