msgid ""
"The mode automatically switches based on the vehicle in front. It is "
"recommended to maintain the standard mode."
msgstr "自動根據前車動態切換風格。建議維持標準模式。"

msgid "Overtaking Coasting Mode (OCM)"
msgstr "超車滑行模式 (OCM)"

msgid ""
"Smoothly coast down to your set speed without engine braking when you exceed"
