#. 自動由簡體轉換為繁體（台灣用語），建議人工複核
#: openpilot/selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/firehose.py
msgid ""
"For maximum effectiveness, bring your device inside and connect to a good USB-C adapter and Wi-Fi weekly.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode can also work while you're driving if connected to a hotspot or unlimited SIM card.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Frequently Asked Questions\n"
"\n"
"Does it matter how or where I drive? Nope, just drive as you normally would.\n"
"\n"
"Do all of my segments get pulled in Firehose Mode? No, we selectively pull a subset of your segments.\n"
"\n"
"What's a good USB-C adapter? Any fast phone or laptop charger should be fine.\n"
"\n"
"Does it matter which software I run? Yes, only upstream openpilot (and particular forks) are able to be used for training."
msgstr ""
"為達到最佳效果，請將裝置帶到室內，並每週連線優質 USB‑C 充電器與 Wi‑Fi。\n"
"\n"
"若連線熱點或不限流量卡，行車中也可使用 Firehose 模式。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"常見問題\n"
"\n"
"我怎麼開、在哪開有區別嗎？沒有，平常怎麼開就怎麼開。\n"
"\n"
"Firehose 模式會拉取我所有片段嗎？不會，我們會選擇性拉取部分片段。\n"
"\n"
"什麼是好的 USB‑C 充電器？任何快速的手機或筆電充電器都可以。\n"
"\n"
"我跑什麼軟體有區別嗎？有，只有上游 openpilot（及特定分支）可用於訓練。"

