msgid "Stop for red lights and stop signs using the driving model's own predicted trajectory to place a virtual stop-line obstacle for the planner. No separate traffic light detector is required."
msgstr "利用駕駛模型自身預測的行駛軌跡，在停止線位置放置虛擬障礙物，讓規劃器據此煞車，藉此在紅綠燈與停止標誌前停等。不需要額外的紅綠燈偵測器。"

