# 說明: 停止線位置微調描述
msgid "Fine-tune where the virtual stop-line obstacle is placed. Positive values move it further away (stop later, closer to the line); negative values pull it closer to the car (stop earlier, further back from the line)."
msgstr "微調虛擬停止線障礙物的放置位置。正值會將其移動至較遠處（較晚煞車、較接近停止線）；負值則會將其拉近至本車（較早煞車、停在較後方）。"

